# Runtime logs. store.py appends here on every query, solve and observe, so a
# demo run or the test suite leaves the tree dirty and the diff full of local
# call traffic. The directory is created by _write_line's makedirs and every
# reader guards on os.path.exists, so nothing needs a placeholder in git.
src/data/logs/
